      "hash": "0761ff1f93abba5b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "いらっしゃいませぇ！\\nなにを　おもとめですか？"
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "id": "kisekae_item_shop_02",
      "hash": "0762001f93abbc0e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……って　おきゃくさまぁ！？\\nしょうひん　すべて\\r\\nおかいあげ　されてまぁす！！"
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "id": "kisekae_item_shop_03",
      "hash": "0762011f93abbdc1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR STYLEITEM(0001)]　は\\n[VAR NUM6(0002,0000)]円　と　なっておりまぁす！"
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "id": "kisekae_item_shop_04",
      "hash": "0762021f93abbf74",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "かいまぁす！"
    },
