      "index": 183,
      "id": "kisekae_item_shop_06",
      "hash": "0762041f93abc2da",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "おかいもとめ\\nありがとう　ございまぁす！"
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "id": "kisekae_item_shop_07",
      "hash": "0762051f93abc48d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]は\\n[VAR STYLEITEM(0001)]を\\r\\nおきがえトランクに　しまった！"
